&lt;li&gt;Assist in lab bring up, test and operation, and offer resolutions and rework instructions when required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use strong configuration and change management skills to produce and modify wiring designs within the aircraft design framework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Mechanical, Electrical, Aerospace Engineering or related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in engineering and design of aircraft wiring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Wiring CAD software: Mentor Graphics Capital, HarnessXC and Logic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands on experience in the processes involved in fabricating, installing, and inspecting harnesses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective communicator, comfortable working cross-functionally with electrical, mechanical, and manufacturing teams&lt;/li&gt;
