&lt;li&gt;Maintain a discreet, low-profile posture that protects principals while respecting their privacy, schedules, and the way they work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Leadership &amp;amp; Building&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
