&lt;li&gt;Own and scale Archer&#39;s executive protection program globally, designing the protocols, standards, and operating procedures that define how EP is delivered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, lead, mentor, and schedule a team of protection agents and/or vetted vendor resources, holding all to a high standard of professionalism and discretion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remain nimble and willing to work outside a fixed job description to move the program forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
