&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Raspberry Pi and other embedded systems platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating RF subsystems (SDR receivers, GNSS, antennas) into embedded products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PCB design experience (schematic, layout, bring-up), or a proven record specifying, directing, and auditing vendor-executed board design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with 3D CAD for mechanical/enclosure design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has taken at least one embedded system from prototype through production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong vendor management: writing specs, evaluating proposals/deliverables, and holding external design partners accountable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient with Multimeter and soldering Iron.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
