&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with mission-system requirements management and payload-to-airframe integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to work across the full development lifecycle — concept through prototype — in a fast-paced, resource-constrained environment&lt;/li&gt;
