&lt;div&gt;Join Archer Aviation&#39;s Mass Properties team and play a critical role in bringing electric vertical takeoff and landing (eVTOL) aircraft from concept to certified reality. As a Mass Properties Engineer, you&#39;ll be the backbone of our weight and balance programs—ensuring every gram counts as we push the boundaries of sustainable urban air mobility.&lt;br&gt;This isn&#39;t a desk job. You&#39;ll get hands-on with actual aircraft, manage data that directly influences flight performance, and see your work take to the skies.&lt;/div&gt;
