&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Critical Data Programs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead day-to-day execution of mass properties programs across multiple aircraft platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain the master database tracking weight, CG, and inertia for all aircraft variants—the single source of truth for the entire engineering organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bridge Design and Reality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with design, structures, and systems teams to validate mass assumptions and drive weight optimization decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the evolution of mass data from early estimates through measured flight hardware—you&#39;ll track every component&#39;s journey&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Get Hands-On with Aircraft&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
