&lt;li&gt;Execute weight and balance audits that ensure flight safety and performance targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support Certification &amp;amp; Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare documentation and analysis supporting FAA certification activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all mass properties data meets regulatory requirements for weight and balance compliance&lt;/li&gt;
