&lt;p data-start=&quot;1949&quot; data-end=&quot;2030&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or a related field&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
