&lt;li&gt;Experience following systems engineering principles in a non-aerospace industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Model-Based Systems Engineering (MBSE) methodologies and tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of safety assessment processes (SAE ARP4761).&lt;/li&gt;
