&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Base Salary Range: $160,000 - $200,000&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior Staff Level: 12+ years of relevant engineering experience, with a history of driving multi-year technical strategy and cross-organizational impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Base Salary Range: $200,000 - $240,000&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
